  "col_right L3, L5: «Thāwun al-Iskandarānī» has the bars over the a of «Thāwun» and over the last a and the last i of «Iskandarānī» (2.2 by 1.0 points); «Battānī» has the bars over the a and the last i.",
  "col_right L4: the hyphen at the end of «al-» is printed as a small round point at mid height (1.2 by 1.0 points); read as a hyphen.",
  "col_right L14: the m of «em.» is printed broken, like ın; read m.",
